## Local templates

To initialize from a local template folder, run:

```
form0 init --local --template-root /path/to/templates my-app
```

`--template-root` can point directly to `form0-web-tmpl-react-vite` /
`form0-mobile-tmpl-react-native-expo`, or to a parent directory that contains those folders.
You can also use environment variables:

```
FORM0_TEMPLATE_SOURCE=local FORM0_TEMPLATE_ROOT=/path/to/templates form0 init my-app
```
